0..53 Comment "//! Polymorphic lists support length, append and map."
54..57 Comment "//!"
58..112 Comment "//! An arm can return a call result or elide `return`."
113..160 Comment "//! It can nest the call under its constructor."
161..199 Comment "//! A fold can infer its element type."
200..203 Comment "//!"
204..249 Comment "//! Each structural call uses a smaller list."
250..313 Comment "//! The recursive natural-list source instantiates these folds."
314..317 Comment "//!"
